    <ont:provinceText>Germaniae inferioris</ont:provinceText>
    <ont:province rdf:resource="https://provincia.uni-graz.at/resource/province/germania-inferior"/>
    <ont:note>Attested in inscriptions of vexillations of the army of Germania inferior dedicated to Hercules Saxanus (CIL XIII 7715, 7716, 7967).</ont:note>
    <ont:note>The governorship is securely attested; only its dating is uncertain: PIR says 'fortasse ab a. 101 usque ad a. 103/104'.</ont:note>
  </ont:GovernorshipFactoid>
  <ont:GovernorshipFactoid rdf:about="https://provincia.uni-graz.at/resource/factoid/pir-a-544-gov-a-544-1">
